function GetFluidRainbow() return Color3.fromHSV(tick() % 1, 1, 1) end
function GetDarkRainbow() return Color3.fromHSV(tick() % 1, 1, 0.6) end
function GetAlternatingColor(c1, c2)
    local alpha = (math.sin(tick() * 4) + 1) / 2
    return c1:Lerp(c2, alpha)
end

